title: Getting Ready
files:
  - .assets/img-100-00-01.png
  - .assets/img-100-00-02.png
  - .assets/img-100-00-03.png
  - .assets/img-100-00-04.png
  - .assets/img-100-00-05.png
  - .assets/ani-100-00-06.gif

steps:
  - cmds:
      - view 1
    text: |

      {[ht,construction]&thinsp;Getting Ready}

      <div class="em-info"

      Arrange your screen as show.

      Click the **Next** button when done.

      </div>

  - cmds:
    text: |

      {[ht,$start]&thinsp;Welcome Aboard}

      This initial tour has three primary objectives:

      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]} Learning how to use the **TOUR GUIDE**.<br>
      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]} Removing some visual clutter from the UI.<br>
      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]} Request a key to unlock the **Wokwi** simulator.

      To proceed through the current tour, you'll use the six buttons across the top of this view:

      {[DC,1]} **Refresh** &ndash; replay the current stop on this tour<br>
      {[DC,2]} **Restart** &ndash; rewind to the first stop on this tour <br>
      {[DC,3]} **Back** &ndash; go to the previous stop on this tour<br>
      {[DC,4]} **Next** &ndash; go to the next stop on this tour<br>
      {[DC,5]} **Screenshot** &ndash; save a screenshot of the this stop<br>
      {[DC,6]} **End** &ndash; stop this tour and close the **TOUR GUIDE**<br>

      Click the **Next** button to continue with **Tour&thinsp;00**&thinsp;&hellip;

  - cmds:
      - view 2
    text: |

      {[ht,household_supplies]&thinsp;Tidying Up &ndash; Activity Bar}

      You can remove some extraneous elements from the **Activity Bar** at the left of the **VS Code** window.

      Right-click inside the **Activity Bar** and uncheck the items suggested in the screenshot.

      We also moved the **EM&bull;Browser** and **EM&bull;Tours** activities to the top and bottom &ndash; for easy reference.

      {[in]To zoom in&thinsp;&middot;&thinsp;out within the image's editor tab, press <b>Ctrl</b> (or <b>Cmd</b>) while scrolling your mouse down&thinsp;&middot;&thinsp;up.}

      Suggestions only &ndash; click **Next** and let's keep moving&thinsp;&hellip;

  - cmds:
      - view 3
    text: |

      {[ht,household_supplies]&thinsp;Tidying Up &ndash; Outline View}

      You should place the **Outline View** in the **Secondary Side Bar** &ndash; even if it has nothing to show.

      The **Outline View** proves invaluable once we start exploring some **EM&bull;Script** source code.

      {[DC,1]} select **View > Open View** from the main menu<br>
      {[DC,2]} type `Outline` to locate then `<ENTER>` to open<br>
      {[DC,3]} drag the **OUTLINE** tab to the **Secondary Side Bar**<br>
      {[DC,4]} drop the **OUTLINE** tab just below **CHAT**<br>

      Again, suggestions only &ndash; click **Next** to continue&thinsp;&hellip;

  - cmds:
      - view 4
    text: |

      {[ht,key]&thinsp;Wokwi Simulator &ndash; Request a Key}

      To streamline entry into the **EM&bull;porium**, we'll use the **Wokwi Simulator** already present in the environment.

      Switch to the **EM&bull;Home** editor tab and click **Request a Wokwi Key** {[dc,1]}.&thinsp; Then select **Open** {[dc,2]} to visit the website.

      <div class="em-info">

      We assume you've already registered at [wokwi.com](https://wokwi.com).

      </div>

      You'll then **SIGN IN** {[dc,3]} and choose **GET YOUR LICENSE** {[dc,4]}.

      Click **NEXT** to continue the process&thinsp;&hellip;

  - cmds:
      - view 5
    text: |

      {[ht,content_copy]&thinsp;Wokwi Simulator &ndash; Copy&middot;Paste the Key}

      **GET YOUR LICENSE** displays a dialog offering to open **VS Code**.&thinsp; Click **Cancel** {[dc,5]} to dismiss.

      Instead, you'll **Copy** {[dc,6]} the complete license key to the clipboard and then return to the **EM&bull;porium** window.

      <div class="em-info">

      Back in **VS Code**, launch its **Command Palette** [press **F1**] and then type `wokwi` to display a drop-down menu.

      </div>

      Choose **Manually Enter License Key** {[dc,7]} to reveal an in&shy;put box (not shown), where you can **Paste** the clipboard's key.

      If successful, the **Wokwi** extension confirms {[dc,8]} activation.

  - cmds:
      - view 6
    text: |

      {[ht,movie]&thinsp;Enjoy the Show}

      Sit back and relax&thinsp;&hellip;&thinsp; This animation gives you a "sneak pre&shy;view" of the **First Examples** tour you'll take next.

      You'll first select the tour from the **EM&bull;TOURS** view, and then use the familiar **TOUR GUIDE** button between stops.

      <div class="em-info">

      At one point in the animation, we'll actually pop back to *this* tour to review setup of **Wokwi Simulator**.

      </div>

      Bottom line &ndash; **Wokwi** will serve (for now) as default *target HW platform* as you learn more about **EM&bull;Script**.

      <div class="em-info">

      Click **Refresh** to replay this 30-second animation.

  - cmds:
    text: |

      {[ht,$steps]&thinsp;Next Steps}

      With setup now behind us, let the learning begin 📚&thinsp;&hellip;

      After you **End** this tour by clicking the red square, we'll show the **EM&bull;TOURS** view in the **Primary Side Bar**.

      From here, proceed to the next tour in the **Welcome Aboard** bundle by clicking (once) on **First Programs**.

      {[hc]}
